    },
    "body": "Separate unary cue scores can lose an ordered relation between cues. Add an opt-in sixteen-coefficient Q4 interaction of two directed H4 relation roots, using the existing checked Q25 pair compiler to construct a64KiB table. The new contribution masks either absent root and uses lookup/add. Unary-only bundles retain their metadata/file layout; joint bundles bind separate packed/shadow payloads and actual table/basis receipts throughout cue→prefix→endpoint reload. The Q25 observation basis is rounded, not exact Z[phi]; whole-model opcode/laptop qualification remains outstanding.\n\nThe dedicated offline loss gives final native marginal credit only to the joint coefficients. Actual512 development rows /5,128 target positions pass zero-overlay numerical/state/route/mass/generated-output parity, independent source reload and native trace parity. All16 gradients are finite/nonzero while source/unary parameters and prefix/end payloads stay fixed. One signed quarter intervention at coordinate14 lowers native CE0.9665787502842376→0.9644756729173819. First-token correctness219→224 (8 gains/3 losses), complete answers59→58 (2 gains/3 losses). Retain this as sensitivity evidence; no fit, adoption, transfer or chat improvement is claimed. Zero optimizer updates and zero evaluation predictions.\n\nValidation at numerical source5d5b4c56587615d08efea73fe0173c3ab1d689fe:2 integer tests,2 exact new training tests,43 fitter and49 observer tests, formatting and release build pass. Checks180.361s CPU8 /3,138,940,928B peak; actual foundation60.047s CPU16 /7,908,687,872B peak on Linuxx86 podfc889a47ddcc with CUDA hidden. Binary66f31a127f775ac7f8e7f0bbd7b5b1c88a22a7795611d0cca9412bb87d6a24d7. Two prior fixture failures are preserved (dtype and unsupported emission alias); guarded probes did not start. Existing unary terminal-rebind test does not cover optional-joint export; that branch is source-inspected only. Later head7edd557a changes owning documentation only; numerical input hashes are unchanged, not an additional compile/run receipt.\n\nFull456,795,105B report and all attempts/commands/binary/inventories remain canonical /workspace/uor-r4/codex/cue-joint-foundation/. Laptop holds small receipt subset only. Pod released/deleted; canonical Codex storage6.5GiB, with1.4GiB volatile source before deletion. Complete work precharged120 minutes, including failures/retry/review/preservation. DeepSeek's offline softmax/tensor-core work is unchanged.\n\nNext inspect the three completion harms before a bounded joint-only learning experiment with useful-output guards; retain zero parent, fixed pair, frozen reversed/companion controls and an unexposed composition panel for later qualification.\n\nReferences #820. Stacked on PR #1767; not merged to main.\n",
